<view class="page"><text class="eyebrow">DOCUMENT INTELLIGENCE</text><view class="heading">把材料变成信息。</view><view class="muted">上传本次办理需要的图片；识别后仍需逐项核对。</view><view class="card stack"><view class="scan-frame {{loading?'scanning':''}}"><view class="scan-line"/><text>{{loading?'正在读取与识别材料…':'PNG / JPEG / WebP · 最大 8MB'}}</text></view><button bindtap="choose" loading="{{loading}}" disabled="{{loading}}">拍照 / 选择材料图片</button><text class="notice">图片会发送至配置的模型服务；仅上传你有权处理的材料。</text><textarea value="{{text}}" bindinput="input" maxlength="10000" placeholder="也可粘贴文字：姓名：林晓（每项单独一行）"/><button class="secondary" bindtap="parse" disabled="{{loading || !text}}">从文字提取字段</button><button class="secondary" data-sample="true" bindtap="parse" disabled="{{loading}}">使用虚构样本体验</button></view><view wx:if="{{error}}" class="error">{{error}}</view><view wx:if="{{ocr}}" class="card"><view class="row"><text class="section-title">识别结果</text><text class="badge">{{ocr.mode==='vision'?'图像识别':ocr.mode==='sample'?'演示样本':'文字提取'}}</text></view><view wx:for="{{fields}}" wx:key="key" class="field"><text class="field-label">{{item.key}}</text><text selectable>{{item.value}}</text></view><view wx:if="{{!fields.length}}" class="muted">未找到可提取的字段，请使用更清晰的图片或检查文字格式。</view><view wx:for="{{ocr.warnings}}" wx:key="*this" class="notice">{{item}}</view><button class="secondary gap" bindtap="recheck" loading="{{loading}}" disabled="{{loading}}">结合识别信息重新核验</button><button class="gap" bindtap="next">生成可编辑表单 →</button></view></view>